flowchart LR
    User([Pet owner]) -->|owner, pets, tasks| UI[Streamlit UI<br/>app.py]
    UI -->|new task text| IG{Input guardrails<br/>guardrails.py}
    IG -- blocked --> Reject[Show reason, task not added]
    IG -- ok / warn --> Store[(Owner, Pet, Task<br/>pawpal_system.py)]

    UI -->|Run Care Advisor| Agent

    subgraph Agent[Care Advisor agent - agent.py]
        direction TB
        P1[1. PLAN<br/>Scheduler.generate_plan] --> P2[2. GUARD<br/>check_safety on each task]
        P2 --> P3[3. REPAIR loop<br/>detect_conflicts, find_next_available_slot]
        P3 --> P4{4. VERIFY<br/>conflicts left?}
        P4 -- yes, tries left --> P3
        P4 -- no / out of tries --> P5[5. RETRIEVE<br/>guidance per task]
        P5 --> P6[6. EXPLAIN<br/>template or optional model]
        P6 --> P7[Confidence score]
    end

    Store --> P1
    KB[(knowledge/*.md)] --> R[retriever.py<br/>TF-IDF search]
    R --> P5
    LLM[llm.py<br/>optional Claude call] -.-> P6
    P6 --> OG{Output guardrail<br/>no doses, no unsafe advice}
    OG -- rejected --> Template[Fallback template]

    P7 --> Result[Proposals + sources + confidence]
    Template --> Result
    OG -- ok --> Result
    Agent -.->|every step| Log[(logs/agent.log)]

    Result --> Human{Human review<br/>approve each change}
    Human -- approved --> Apply[apply_proposals<br/>update task times]
    Human -- rejected --> Keep[Schedule unchanged]
    Apply --> Store

    Tests[tests/ + evaluate.py] -.->|reliability checks| Agent
